s","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LRJiao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LRJiao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LRJiao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LRJiao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98370#pullrequestreview-2391357034","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98370","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98370#pullrequestreview-2391357034"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98370"}},"submitted_at":"2024-10-24T05:48:49Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2393374951,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6OqADn","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"DISMISSED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98370#pullrequestreview-2393374951","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98370","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98370#pullrequestreview-2393374951"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98370"}},"submitted_at":"2024-10-24T17:54:08Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2418837813,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6QLIk1","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally on [Truck Town](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/3d/truck_town), there's an issue in 3D with gizmo icons disappearing for some 3D nodes (such as Light3D) even when they're not part of a subscene:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eebbcbf8-d32f-4cf0-9161-6c884d5cbf77\r\n\r\nThe gizmo will disappear even when the node is currently selected.\r\n\r\nThis may be due to a conflict with the logic used for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/75303, although it does not affect Light3D *icons* (only their lines).","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98370#pullrequestreview-2418837813","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98370","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98370#pullrequestreview-2418837813"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98370"}},"submitted_at":"2024-11-06T16:21:59Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2462690754,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Sya3C","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally (rebased on top of `master` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/bbc54692c05ff6a85a6aeefbf5b9c87de91983d8), the base functionality works as expected.\r\n\r\nHowever, in the 3D editor, there's still a remaining issue: **Hide Subscene Gizmos** is not persisted to the scene's editor state, which means it gets reset when you use **Save > Reload Saved Scene** after saving the scene. This does not happen to **View Origin** and **View Grid** in the same menu, which are correctly preserved after a scene reload:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7bd8e66-6fc4-4244-910f-20aae9870d81)\r\n\r\nIf I restart the editor after saving the scene, the option will appear checked but subscene gizmos (the collision shape in Truck Town's `town_scene.tscn`) will still appear:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b2e95d4-9862-459a-82ee-06e310615083)\r\n\r\nThe same issue occurs in the 2D editor:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8b388d0-3d57-4058-98f1-16818ab10897)\r\n\r\nWhen restarting the editor, this gets restored to:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf11c8e7-8b7a-4c0f-ab92-769680d2449f)\r\n\r\n(The last 4 options are enabled by default, so having them disabled is a non-default state that is persisted correctly.)\r\n\r\nAlso, please amend the commit message to be more descriptive:\r\n\r\n> Add an option to toggle gizmo subscene visibility in the 2D and 3D editor","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98370#pullrequestreview-2462690754","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98370","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98370#pullrequestreview-2462690754"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98370"}},"submitted_at":"2024-11-26T21:17:11Z","commit_id":"4ae3233a07f3ea3666949ccaa3180aff3702b195"}]